{{!
    @template tool_lp/linked_courses_summary

    The courses using a competency, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/linked_courses_summary of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/linked_courses_summary.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every
    core upgrade.

    Kept from core: the sentence above the list, an ordered list of links to each course's view
    address, the course names triple-stashed (the exporter formats them) and the "no linked courses"
    string when there are none.
    Changed: one row per course with the short name as a quiet label inside the same link, so the
    link's text is core's; the empty case is a paragraph
    rather than bare text inside the list, which core's markup put directly in an ol.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * courses - array of viewurl, fullname, shortname

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courses": [
            {
                "viewurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=2",
                "fullname": "Leadership in practice",
                "shortname": "LEAD-01"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="dim-comp-courses">
    <p class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}coursesusingthiscompetency, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
    {{#courses.0}}
    <ol class="dim-comp-courses__list">
        {{#courses}}
        <li class="dim-comp-courses__item">
            <a href="{{viewurl}}">{{{fullname}}} <span class="dim-comp-idnumber">{{{shortname}}}</span></a>
        </li>
        {{/courses}}
    </ol>
    {{/courses.0}}
    {{^courses}}
    <p class="dim-comp-courses__empty">{{#str}}nolinkedcourses, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
    {{/courses}}
</div>
